#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/environment-variables.rst:68
msgid ""
"Base path for well-known output directories. Files in these directories will"
" automatically be found, uploaded, and published."
msgstr "已知输出目录的基础路径。这些目录中的文件将自动被发现、上传并发布。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/environment-variables.rst:70
msgid ""
"You need to concatenate an output format to this variable. Currently valid "
"formats are ``html``, ``pdf``, ``htmlzip``, and ``epub``. (e.g. "
"``$READTHEDOCS_OUTPUT/html/`` or ``$READTHEDOCS_OUTPUT/pdf/``) You also need"
" to create the directory before moving outputs into the destination. You can"
" create it with the following command ``mkdir -p "
"$READTHEDOCS_OUTPUT/html/``. Note that only ``html`` supports multiple "
"files, the other formats should have one and only one file to be uploaded."
msgstr ""
"你需要将输出格式拼接到此变量。当前有效格式为 ``html`` 、``pdf`` 、``htmlzip`` 和 ``epub`` 。（例如 "
"``$READTHEDOCS_OUTPUT/html/`` 或 ``$READTHEDOCS_OUTPUT/pdf/`` "
"）移动输出到目标前需先创建目录，可用命令 ``mkdir -p $READTHEDOCS_OUTPUT/html/`` 创建。注意仅 ``html`` "
"支持多文件，其他格式应仅有一个文件上传。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/environment-variables.rst:80
msgid ":ref:`build-customization:where to put files`"
msgstr ":ref:`build-customization:where to put files`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/environment-variables.rst:81
msgid ""
"Information about using custom commands to generate output that will "
"automatically be published once your build succeeds."
msgstr "关于使用自定义命令生成构建成功后自动发布输出的信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/environment-variables.rst:85
msgid ""
"Canonical base URL for the version that is built. If the project has "
"configured a :doc:`custom domain </custom-domains>` (e.g. "
"``docs.example.com``) it will be used in the resulting canonical URL. "
"Otherwise, your project's :ref:`default subdomain <default-subdomain>` will "
"be used."
msgstr ""
"构建版本的规范基础 URL。如果项目配置了 :doc:`自定义域名 </custom-domains>` （如 ``docs.example.com``"
" ），将在生成的规范 URL 中使用。否则，将使用项目的 :ref:`默认子域名 <default-subdomain>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/environment-variables.rst:89
msgid ""
"The path for the language and version is appended to the domain, so the "
"final canonical base URLs can look like the following examples:"
msgstr "语言和版本的路径会追加到域名后，因此最终的规范基础 URL 可能如下所示："

